<title>RUSSIA: Russia Jun household savings up to 137.6 trln rbls.</title>
<headline>Russia Jun household savings up to 137.6 trln rbls.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russian household savings and deposits in state-owned Sberegatelny Bank RF and other banks rose at the beginning of June to 102.6 trillion roubles and 34.5 trillion roubles respectively, the State Statistics Committee said.</p>
<p>			     June 97		 May 97	  June 96</p>
<p> Household deposits    137.6		   135.4	    96.4</p>
<p>comprising:</p>
<p>    In Sberbank	  102.6		   101.1	    67.6</p>
<p>    In other banks	34.5		    34.3	    28.8</p>
<p>NOTE - Figures for the start of the month, in trillion roubles.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
